<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Treasury to reveal 1996 result at 1700 GMT.</title>
<headline>Brazil Treasury to reveal 1996 result at 1700 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's National Treasury will reveal the federal government's finances for December and for the whole of 1996 at 1500 local time/1700 GMT, a Finance Ministry spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The Gazeta Mercantil newspaper reported the Treasury posted a record 9.0 billion reais deficit last year and a 1.5 billion real deficit in December.</p>
<p>((-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358))</p>
